  "description": "EZIFIF crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C106 H110 Dy8 N30 O46,6(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy1B (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2B (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3B (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4B (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 7 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a chain with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.509-3.814 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.51-111.55°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C112H134Dy8N30O52.",
